---
import SketchSheet from '../design/SketchSheet.astro';
import '../design/design-aids.css';
---
<figure class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface" aria-labelledby="page-read-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Reading a row</span>
  <h3 id="page-read-title">Reading a table page</h3>
  <p>P7 is on page 12, which is not in shared buffers yet. PostgreSQL loads the page to read P7’s price.</p>
  <div class="read-route">
    <SketchSheet><h4>Table file · page 12</h4><div class="page-header">Page header and row locations</div><div class="record">P3 · Plate · 15.00</div><div class="record chosen">P7 · Blue mug · 20.00</div><div class="record">P9 · Jug · 28.00</div><div class="free">Free space</div></SketchSheet>
    <p class="page-transfer"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span>Read page 12</p>
    <SketchSheet tone="teal"><h4>Shared buffer · page 12</h4><div class="page-header">Page header and row locations</div><div class="record">P3 · Plate · 15.00</div><div class="record chosen">P7 · Blue mug · 20.00</div><div class="record">P9 · Jug · 28.00</div><div class="free">Free space</div></SketchSheet>
  </div>
  <p class="answer">Query result: <strong>20.00</strong></p>
  <figcaption>PostgreSQL reads the whole page, including P3 and P9, to return P7’s price of 20.00. Later queries can read any of these products from the buffered page. This drawing shows three products; a real page is usually 8 kB and can hold as many row versions as fit.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .read-route { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 5rem minmax(0,1fr); align-items:center; gap:.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem; }
  .page-header { border-block:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); padding:.4rem 0; color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:.73rem; }
  .record { padding:.55rem .35rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule); font:.8rem/1.5 var(--font-mono); }
  .chosen { background:var(--paper-match); border-left:2px solid var(--teal); }
  .free { padding:.7rem .35rem; font-size:.75rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .page-transfer { font-size:.75rem; text-align:center; }
  .page-transfer span { display:block; font-size:2rem; }
  .answer { text-align:right; padding-right:1rem; font-size:.85rem; }
  @media(max-width:620px) { .read-route { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .page-transfer span { transform:rotate(90deg); } .page-transfer { margin:.2rem 0; } }
</style>
